\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.6}{\ignorespaces  For a sequence of length $N=50$, we compare the difference between the heuristic~\eqref  {prog:ch3_QSD-D''_1CP} and the optimal SDP with the difference between Eq.~\eqref  {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2016bound} and the optimal SDP, as the value of $\gamma ^2 = |\braket {\psi }{\phi _1}|^2$ is varied. Although our heuristic provides a tighter bound than Eq.~\eqref  {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2016bound}, it requires solving an SDP, whereas Eq.~\eqref  {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2016bound} is a closed-form expression. }}{77}{figure.caption.84}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ch3_QSD-ME_compare}{{3.6}{77}{For a sequence of length $N=50$, we compare the difference between the heuristic~\eqref {prog:ch3_QSD-D''_1CP} and the optimal SDP with the difference between Eq.~\eqref {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2016bound} and the optimal SDP, as the value of $\gamma ^2 = |\braket {\psi }{\phi _1}|^2$ is varied. Although our heuristic provides a tighter bound than Eq.~\eqref {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2016bound}, it requires solving an SDP, whereas Eq.~\eqref {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2016bound} is a closed-form expression}{figure.caption.84}{}}
