\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.7}{\ignorespaces  For a sequence of length $N=15$, we compare the difference between the heuristic~\eqref  {prog:ch3_QSD-D''_1CP} and the optimal SDP with the difference between Eq.~\eqref  {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2017approx} and the optimal SDP for varying values of $\gamma $. For $\gamma \leq \gamma ^*=(\sqrt  {5}-1)/2$, the error between the heuristic and the optimal SDP is of order $10^{-5}$. When $\gamma >\gamma ^*$, Eq.~\eqref  {eq:ch3_QSD-sentis2016bound} provides a substantially tighter bound than the heuristic. }}{79}{figure.caption.85}\protected@file@percent }
